'''Grasberg''' is a male [[Human|human]] [[Non-Playable-Character|NPC]] [[Merchants|merchant]] that can be found at the [[Lakeshore]] Crafting Station near the [[Lakeshore]] [[Cooking Table]]. He sells [[Miner]] [[Jobs|Job]] related [[Items|items]].

==Sells==
*{{Member}}[[Quarry Miner Kerchief]]
*{{Member}}[[Quarry Miner Overalls]]
*{{Member}}[[Quarry Miner Helmet]]
*{{Member}}[[Quarry Miner Gloves]]
*{{Member}}[[Quarry Miner Boots]]
*{{Member}}[[Quarry Miner Shirt]]
*[[Miner's Power Shard of Timing III]]
*[[Miner's Necklace of Timing III]]
*[[Miner's Dynamite of Timing III]]

==Trivia==
*Grasberg was introduced in-game on the update of October 15, 2013.
